/-! ## The tier schedule of the classes

Every multiplicity is a power of two, `muT s c = 2 ^ gam s c`, so the weight of a class is
`2 ^ e` for the code sum `e` of its fields. A two-statistic table (`compTableQ`) counts the
accepted field tuples by code sum, which certifies the tier counts of `FusionNumeric.schedule`. -/

namespace FusionCodec

open Tier FusionNumeric

/-- Multiplicity codes of each cost: `muT s c = 2 ^ gam s c`. -/
